Maybe a sharp mind can do better than brute force?

"Doyle, have you studied the indigenous language? Listen, maybe you'll understand something."

Doyle nods and listens to what the savages are saying, then turns to you.

"Well, I've got two news for you. The bad news is that they want to sacrifice Snoopy. This tribe recently lost their fire, now they dance to make gods give them new fire."

"And the good one?"

"You see," Doyle slyly winks, "in theory, we could pretend to be gods. If they get fire, I can probably come to an agreement with them!"

In any case, the plan is risky. But few things in life can be done without risk.